    <item>
      <title>Hey, Listen! Navi in BotW (WiiU)</title>
      <author>zapiltar</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/742763</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/742763#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">ff59a25187ae84ce86ab8c7a3ff3cecc8e6b8c37</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 12:32:23 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6afeec4094f70.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6afeec40a6efc.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6afeec40d288b.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Hey, Listen!&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod brings Navi, the Hero of Time's trusty companion to Breath of the Wild!&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Navi replaces the ZL lock on arrows, speaks to Link, and changes color when targeting.&lt;br&gt;There are volume options, speech frequency options and the choice between the English and Japanese voice performances.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;u&gt;Installation Guide&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Cemu Standalone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Copy the &lt;i&gt;Navi &lt;/i&gt;folder from the zip into Cemu's &lt;i&gt;graphicPacks &lt;/i&gt;folder&lt;br&gt;- In the Graphic Packs menu, check Navi; you can change the mod's settings here too&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Cemu UKMM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Unzip the _ModManager.zip&lt;br&gt;- In UKMM, select &lt;i&gt;Navi (UKMM).zip&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;and install&lt;br&gt;- Hit deploy after applying your other mods, and move the UKMM Graphic Pack to the &lt;i&gt;graphicPacks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;folder&lt;br&gt;- In the Graphic Packs menu, check UKMM and Navi (Code); you can&lt;br&gt;change the mod's settings in Navi (Code)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;Settings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The settings can be changed during gameplay with no restart required.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Tested&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod was made and tested on BotW 1.5.0 on the Cemu emulator version 2.6&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Planned Features&lt;/h1&gt;Navi unlocks post shrine of Resurrection, has a hide and show animation when fast traveling or when real-time cutscenes start. This hides and mutes her to avoid interruptions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;She should hide and reappear before and after Link fast travels, and when cutscenes start and end to keep continuity.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;More idle and active animations and sounds.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Known Issues&lt;/h1&gt;- At 30fps, Navi's body is small and/or missing for a frame or two when changing color states.&lt;br&gt;- Real time cutscenes or dialog that take camera control cause Navi to unhook from the npc that initiated it, letting her speak during the cutscene. Fixed in 2.0&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Other Releases&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/743088"&gt;Switch 1.6.0 Version&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;Upcoming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Totk X.X.X Version&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/navi_botw_wiiu_v10.zip" type="application/zip"/>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/navi_botw_wiiu_v11_modmanager.zip" type="application/zip"/>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/navi_botw_wiiu_v11.zip" type="application/zip"/>
