    <item>
      <title>One-Handed Great Swords (Craftable Copies)</title>
      <author>Molybdenuw</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/739932</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/739932#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">42718947cfc8bbe3ec9e6e1ef37c67daa85a7497</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:15:01 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6af6f0c599f20.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6af6f0c614ae2.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6af6f0c65e152.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One-Handed Great Swords (Craftable Copies)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
Adds a one-handed copy of &lt;strong&gt;every two-handed sword, club and axe&lt;/strong&gt; in the game (41 weapons). Use them with a shield!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
The vanilla two-handed weapons stay untouched. The one-handed versions are &lt;strong&gt;new separate items&lt;/strong&gt; that you craft at the &lt;strong&gt;Ancient Oven in the Akkala Ancient Tech Lab&lt;/strong&gt; (the one that makes ancient gear).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;strong&gt;Recipe:&lt;/strong&gt; 1 original two-handed weapon + rupees (100–1650 rupees depending on the weapon’s strength).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
Includes elemental swords (Flameblade, Frostblade, Thunderblade), the Guardian swords, and special weapons. They keep the original model, stats and effects, including the elemental charge and recharge.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;strong&gt;Names:&lt;/strong&gt; the new weapons are called “One-Handed ...” in Russian and English (EU). Other languages will show an empty name for now.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;strong&gt;Installation (UKMM):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;ol dir="ltr"&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Install the zip in UKMM and click Apply Pending Changes.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;If you are updating from an older version, &lt;strong&gt;remove the old version first&lt;/strong&gt;, then install the new one.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Go to Tools → &lt;strong&gt;Refresh merge&lt;/strong&gt;. Without this step, some weapons may be missing from the oven.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Go to the Akkala Ancient Tech Lab and look at the Ancient Oven’s weapon list.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&#13;
&lt;strong&gt;Compatibility:&lt;/strong&gt; only adds new entries to ActorInfo and the Ancient Oven shop. May conflict with mods that also edit the Ancient Oven shop. Doesn’t change vanilla weapons. Weapon balance mods won’t affect the copies (they use vanilla stats).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;strong&gt;Tested on:&lt;/strong&gt; Cemu 2.6, BOTW EU v208, UKMM.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
